 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-septiembre-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Consideremos \\(F(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Si \\(f\\) fuese la función cuya gráfica aparece en el dibujo, indica si son verdaderas o falsas las siguientes afirmaciones, razonando la respuesta: i) \\(F(\\alpha)=0\\). ii) \\(F'(\\alpha)=0\\). iii) \\(F\\) es creciente en \\((0,\\alpha)\\).<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 170' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='34.8,131.7 36.7,125.4 38.7,119.4 40.6,113.7 42.6,108.3 44.5,103.1 46.4,98.3 48.4,93.8 50.3,89.5 52.3,85.5 54.2,81.8 56.2,78.3 58.1,75.1 60.1,72.2 62.0,69.5 63.9,67.0 65.9,64.8 67.8,62.8 69.8,61.0 71.7,59.4 73.7,58.1 75.6,56.9 77.6,55.9 79.5,55.2 81.5,54.6 83.4,54.2 85.3,54.0 87.3,53.9 89.2,54.0 91.2,54.3 93.1,54.7 95.1,55.3 97.0,56.0 99.0,56.8 100.9,57.8 102.9,58.9 104.8,60.1 106.7,61.4 108.7,62.8 110.6,64.3 112.6,65.9 114.5,67.6 116.5,69.4 118.4,71.3 120.4,73.2 122.3,75.2 124.2,77.3 126.2,79.4 128.1,81.6 130.1,83.8 132.0,86.0 134.0,88.3 135.9,90.5 137.9,92.9 139.8,95.2 141.8,97.5 143.7,99.8 145.6,102.2 147.6,104.5 149.5,106.8 151.5,109.0 153.4,111.3 155.4,113.5 157.3,115.7 159.3,117.8 161.2,119.9 163.1,121.9 165.1,123.9 167.0,125.8 169.0,127.6 170.9,129.3 172.9,131.0 174.8,132.5 176.8,134.0 178.7,135.3 180.7,136.6 182.6,137.7 184.5,138.7 186.5,139.6 188.4,140.4 190.4,141.0 192.3,141.5 194.3,141.8 196.2,142.0 198.2,142.0 200.1,141.8 202.0,141.5 204.0,141.0 205.9,140.3 207.9,139.4 209.8,138.3 211.8,137.0 213.7,135.5 215.7,133.8 217.6,131.9 219.6,129.7 221.5,127.4 223.4,124.8 225.4,121.9 227.3,118.8 229.3,115.4 231.2,111.8 233.2,107.9 235.1,103.8 237.1,99.3 239.0,94.6 241.0,89.6 242.9,84.3 244.8,78.7 246.8,72.8 248.7,66.6 250.7,60.1 252.6,53.2 254.6,46.0 256.5,38.5 258.5,30.6 260.4,22.4 262.3,13.8 264.3,4.9 266.2,-4.4 268.2,-14.0' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><text x='121.6' y='89.1' fill='#334155' font-size='13'>α</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 79.6H294.0M55.5 164.0V8.0'/></g></svg></div>",
     "(1 p.) Calcula \\(F(1)\\) siendo \\(f(t)=\\dfrac1{\\sqrt{t+1}}\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Por el teorema fundamental del cálculo<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f\\) es continua, \\(F(x)=\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt\\) es derivable y \\(F'(x)=f(x)\\).</i>, \\(F'(x)=f(x)\\). En el dibujo, \\(f\\) es positiva en \\((0,\\alpha)\\) y se anula en \\(x=\\alpha\\).</p><p><b>i)</b> \\(F(\\alpha)=\\int_0^\\alpha f(t)\\,dt\\) es el área bajo una curva positiva: \\(F(\\alpha)\\gt0\\). <b>Falsa.</b></p><p><b>ii)</b> \\(F'(\\alpha)=f(\\alpha)=0\\). <b>Verdadera.</b></p><p><b>iii)</b> En \\((0,\\alpha)\\), \\(F'(x)=f(x)\\gt0\\): \\(F\\) es creciente. <b>Verdadera.</b></p><div class='res'>i) falsa; ii) verdadera; iii) verdadera</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[F(1)=\\int_0^1(t+1)^{-1/2}\\,dt=\\Bigl[2\\sqrt{t+1}\\Bigr]_0^1=2\\sqrt2-2\\]<p>(Regla de Barrow<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Barrow: \\(\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=F(b)-F(a)\\), siendo \\(F\\) una primitiva de \\(f\\).</i>.)</p><div class='res'>\\(F(1)=2\\sqrt2-2\\approx0{,}83\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tfc",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "def",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2002-SEPTIEMBRE.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
