  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-septiembre-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Los puntos \\(A(1,0,2)\\) y \\(B(-1,0,-2)\\) son vértices opuestos de un cuadrado.",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Calcula el área del cuadrado.",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el plano perpendicular al segmento de extremos \\(A\\) y \\(B\\) que pasa por su punto medio."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(AB\\) es una diagonal: \\(d=|\\overrightarrow{AB}|=|(-2,0,-4)|=\\sqrt{20}\\). En un cuadrado de lado \\(\\ell\\), \\(d=\\ell\\sqrt2\\), así que \\(\\ell^2=\\frac{d^2}2\\).</p><div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{20}2=10\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Punto medio \\(M=(0,0,0)\\). Normal \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\parallel(1,0,2)\\): plano \\(x+2z+D=0\\), con \\(D=0\\) porque pasa por \\(M\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":33,\"el\":24,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-2.537,2.1,1.268],[-2.537,-1.6,1.268],[2.537,-1.6,-1.268],[2.537,2.1,-1.268]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[2.537,-1.6,-1.268],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[1,0,2],[-1,0,-2],\"#2f6df0\",2,false],[\"pt\",[1,0,2],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,0,-2],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,0],\"M\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m02sa4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m02sa4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m02sa4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m02sa4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='300.8,56.4 155.4,18.0 26.0,207.6 171.3,246.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.0' y='207.6' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='128.1' y1='59.8' x2='179.1' y2='199.0' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='128.1' cy='59.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='135.1' y='53.8' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='179.1' cy='199.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='186.1' y='193.0' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='153.6' cy='129.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='160.6' y='123.4' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='15.3' y2='275.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='9.2' y='281.4' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='37.4' y2='273.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='39.1' y='278.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(x+2z=0\\)</div></div>"
    }
