  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-septiembre-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el plano \\(\\pi\\equiv x-y+2z=3\\) y el punto \\(A(-1,-4,2)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Halla la ecuación de la recta perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\) que pasa por \\(A\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Halla el punto simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto de \\(\\pi\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Director: la normal de \\(\\pi\\), \\(\\vec n=(1,-1,2)\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\begin{cases}x=-1+\\lambda\\\\y=-4-\\lambda\\\\z=2+2\\lambda\\end{cases}\\), \\(\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Uso la recta del apartado a).</p><p><b>Paso 1. Recta perpendicular al plano por el punto.</b> Como la recta \\(s\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\) son perpendiculares, el vector normal del plano es paralelo al vector director de la recta<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si la recta es perpendicular al plano, su dirección es la del vector normal del plano: por eso sirve \\(\\vec n\\) como vector director.</i>: \\(\\vec d=\\vec n=(1,\\ -1,\\ 2)\\). Pasa por \\(A(-1,\\ -4,\\ 2)\\):</p>\\[s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=-1+t\\\\y=-4-t\\\\z=2+2t\\end{cases}\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte.</b> Sustituyo las paramétricas de \\(s\\) en \\(\\pi\\equiv x-y+2z-3=0\\):</p>\\[(-1+t)-(-4-t)+2(2+2t)-3=0\\iff 6t+4=0\\iff t=-\\frac{2}{3}\\]\\[M\\left(-\\frac{5}{3},\\ -\\frac{10}{3},\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Punto medio.</b> \\(M\\) es el punto medio entre \\(A\\) y su simétrico \\(A'(a,b,c)\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>El simétrico \\(P'\\) cumple que \\(M\\) es el punto medio del segmento \\(PP'\\): cada coordenada de \\(M\\) es la media de las de \\(P\\) y \\(P'\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\frac{-1+a}2=-\\frac{5}{3},\\qquad\\frac{-4+b}2=-\\frac{10}{3},\\qquad\\frac{2+c}2=\\frac{2}{3}\\]\\[a=-\\frac{7}{3},\\qquad b=-\\frac{8}{3},\\qquad c=-\\frac{2}{3}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":32,\"el\":24,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-1.497,-1.655,1.421],[-3.345,-3.503,1.421],[-1.836,-5.011,-0.088],[0.011,-3.164,-0.088]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-1.836,-5.011,-0.088],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-2.567,-2.433,-1.133],[-0.767,-4.233,2.467],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-0.767,-4.233,2.467],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[-0.8,-4.2,2.4],[-0.333,-4.667,3.333],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[-2.359,-4.026,0.667],[-1.893,-4.493,1.6],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"line\",[-1.52,-3.48,0.96],[-1.774,-3.734,0.96],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-1.774,-3.734,0.96],[-1.921,-3.587,0.667],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[-1.0,-4.0,2.0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1.667,-3.333,0.667],\"M\",8,12],[\"pt\",[-2.333,-2.667,-0.667],\"A′\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m02sb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m02sb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m02sb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m02sb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='216.7,137.9 181.3,75.7 56.3,170.3 91.7,232.6' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='60.3' y='170.3' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='211.1' y1='246.0' x2='61.9' y2='62.2' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='67.9' y='62.2' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='64.7' y1='65.6' x2='26.0' y2='18.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m02sb4d)'/><text x='30.0' y='14.0' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='123.2' y1='130.8' x2='84.6' y2='83.1' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m02sb4n)'/><text x='88.6' y='79.1' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='700'>n</text><line x1='124.3' y1='139.1' x2='119.5' y2='130.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='119.5' y1='130.6' x2='131.6' y2='145.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='81.2' cy='86.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='88.2' y='80.1' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='136.5' cy='154.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='144.5' y='166.1' font-weight='700'>M</text><circle cx='191.7' cy='222.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='198.7' y='216.2' font-weight='700'>A′</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='15.5' y2='275.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='9.6' y='281.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='37.6' y2='273.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='39.3' y='278.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='255.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='254.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector normal</text></g><g transform='translate(249.9,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(353.4,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto de \\(\\pi\\) es \\(A'\\left(-\\frac{7}{3},\\ -\\frac{8}{3},\\ -\\frac{2}{3}\\right)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: al sustituir en el primer miembro del plano, \\(A\\) da \\(4\\) y \\(A'\\) da \\(-4\\): valores opuestos, así que están a la misma distancia y a lados distintos del plano ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
